ecord and DNSSEC Authentication Chain Extension for TLS", "type": "/api/v1/name/doctypename/draft/", "uploaded_filename": "", "words": 6227}, {"abstract": "   This draft describes a new TLS extension for transport of a DNS\n   record set serialized with the DNSSEC signatures needed to\n   authenticate that record set.  The intent of this proposal is to\n   allow TLS clients to perform DANE authentication of a TLS server\n   without needing to perform additional DNS record lookups.  It is not\n   intended to be used to validate the TLS server's address records.\n", "ad": "/api/v1/person/person/104851/", "doc": "/api/v1/doc/document/draft-ietf-tls-dnssec-chain-extension/", "expires": "2018-09-22T14:47:00Z", "external_url": "", "group": "/api/v1/group/group/1326/", "id": 215007, "intended_std_level": "/api/v1/name/intendedstdlevelname/ps/", "keywords": "[]", "name": "draft-ietf-tls-dnssec-chain-extension", "note": "", "notify": "Joseph Salowey <joe@salowey.net>, shuque@gmail.com", "pages": 24, "resource_uri": "/api/v1/doc/dochistory/215007/", "rev": "07", "rfc_number": null, "shepherd": "/api/v1/person/email/joe@salowey.net/", "states": ["/api/v1/doc/state/1/", "/api/v1/doc/state/115/", "/api/v1/doc/state/12/", "/api/v1/doc/state/44/"], "std_level": null, "stream": "/api/v1/name/streamname/ietf/", "tags": ["/api/v1/name/doctagname/ad-f-up/"], "time": "2018-03-21T14:47:00Z", "title": "A DANE Record and DNSSEC Authentication Chain Extension for TLS", "type": "/api/v1/name/doctypename/draft/", "uploaded_filename": "", "words": 6227}, {"abstract": "   This draft describes a new TLS extension for transport of a DNS\n   record set serialized with the DNSSEC signatures needed to\n   authenticate that record set.  The intent of this proposal is to\n   allow TLS clients to perform DANE authentication of a TLS server\n   without needing to perform additional DNS record lookups.  It is not\n   intended to be used to validate the TLS server's address records.\n", "ad": "/api/v1/pe